"an [active profile](profile-setup.md#what-the-active-profile-means). "
"Create one at a terminal so you can record and verify its one-time "
"recovery phrase:"
msgstr ""
"egy [aktív profil](profile-setup.md#what-the-active-profile-means). "
"Hozzon létre egyet nem interaktív módon:"

#: ../../how-to/check-aeat-notifications.md:41
msgid ""
"the taxpayer's fiscal ID (generalized as NIF, CIF, DNI, NIE, or NII) "
"saved in that profile"
msgstr ""
"az adózó abban a profilban mentett adóazonosítója (általánosítva NIF, "
"CIF, DNI, NIE vagy NII)"

#: ../../how-to/check-aeat-notifications.md:42
